Subject: Cantor Identity Accounting Store Bootstrap P3 Requirement Matrix

& [RequirementMatrix]
  + IAB-01 existing regular non-symlink input and absent target are enforced by metadata checks and existing-target fixture
  + IAB-02 positive three-bound validation is enforced before filesystem creation
  + IAB-03 metadata and post-read ledger bounds are enforced before deserialization
  + IAB-04 P0 ledger validation is exercised by digest-tamper refusal
  + IAB-05 canonical byte equality is exercised by pretty-JSON refusal
  + IAB-06 P1 genesis construction is exercised by exact receipt and restored event identity
  + IAB-07 initial-create-only directory custody is exercised by preserved pre-existing sentinel content
  + IAB-08 P2 persist and reload are exercised by direct bootstrap then MCP server restart
  + IAB-09 exact empty cleanup is exercised by post-create snapshot-capacity failure
  + IAB-10 one canonical JSON receipt plus newline and no failure stdout are exercised by subprocess fixture
  + IAB-11 all declared receipt bindings are asserted against the restored journal
  + IAB-12 exact ordered one-shot CLI grammar is exercised through the built bootstrap binary
  + IAB-13 success restart existing target noncanonical tamper ledger and snapshot bounds cleanup and subprocess paths are covered by six fixtures
  + IAB-14 no model network extraction admission overwrite migration effect or publication is verified by crate boundary inspection

& [FormationState] is all_requirements_implemented_and_locally_verified_pending_clean_replay
